        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Industry data.\n\n# Included processes\nThe module does not include input of fuel (basic oxygen furnace gas) because BOF gas is treated as a waste product of steel production (i.e. zero allocation to blast furnace gas). Nevertheless, the module includes the emissions caused by the burning of the gas in the power plant. It includes also power plant infrastructure.The inventory includes specific emissions to air from a basic oxygen furnace with supressed combustion after abatement.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
